              "value": "Solidify Mist"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(primal, transmutation, water)\n\nThe mist stalker makes its mist cloud congeal, causing the aura to be difficult terrain until the start of the mist stalker's next turn.\n\nIn addition, the mist stalker can make the mist even thicker around a single Medium or smaller creature within the cloud. The creature must succeed at a 20 Reflex save or become immobilized until it Escapes or it is no longer in the mist cloud's emanation."
